The SVG files in this folder are a curated subset of the @carbon/icons package
(version 11.88.0, github.com/carbon-design-system/carbon, packages/icons/src/svg/32),
copied unchanged. manifest.json records the original Carbon name of every file.

The png/ folder holds the same icons rasterised at 256 x 256 pixels as black glyphs on a
transparent ground, for the PowerPoint builder, which recolours them through the alpha
channel. They are derived from the SVG files above under the same licence.
